  m_text: "VOICE CAST\r\nOKABE WRIGHT\u3000ENISHI NAO\r\nHARU THE BUTCHER\u3000KAMIO
    TAICHI\r\nTANIHIRA AMUNDSEN\u3000USUI YUMENO\r\nSARUTOBI SHOGO\u3000ISHIKURA
    IWA\r\nHATANO ERIKSON\u3000KAWAGUCHI KANADE\r\nOPERATOR\u3000NAKAGAWA NATSUMI\r\nMOAI\u3000KIM
    YEJUN\r\n\r\nPROJECT SEPTEMBER\r\nCo-Director\r\nOKABE YUYA\u3000\u3000SHIRAISHI
    HARU\r\n\r\n\r\nPROGRAMMER UNIT\r\nLead Game Programmer\r\nTAKECHI MIKUTO\r\n\r\nGame
    Programmer\r\nUSUGI TSUYOSHI\u3000\u3000KAKINUMA YUZUKI\nKOINUMA SHOGO\u3000\u3000SHIOMI
    KAZUKA\nYAMAMOTO UMI\u3000\u3000TAKAMURA RENGA\r\nIWAKI EISUKE\u3000\u3000YAMAMOTO
    YUZUHA\r\n\r\nTechnical Artist\r\nMIYAZAKI HIKARU\r\n\r\nTool Programmer\r\nYOSHIDA
    RYUICHIRO\r\n\r\n\r\nPLANNER UNIT\r\nLead Game Planner\r\nISHII KATSUYOSHI\r\n\r\nPlanner\r\nIZUMI
    SHUGO\u3000\u3000SHUTO MIZUHO\r\nSHIRAISHI TAKAHIRO\u3000\u3000HOZUMI REINA\r\n\r\n\r\n3D
    ARTIST UNIT\r\nLead Artist\r\nTANIHIRA AKIRA\r\n\r\nEnvironment Artist\r\nMIYAMOTO
    JUNYO\u3000\u3000OKUBO TATSUKI\r\n\r\nCharacter Modeler\r\nISHIBASHI RIKU\u3000\u3000ODE
    RIKUTO\nGOTO NONOMI\u3000\u3000HATANO MISUZU\nHIROSE TEINA\u3000\u3000SUZUKI
    HOKUTO\r\n\r\nRigger\r\nNOZAWA SEIYA\r\n\r\nAnimator\r\nUSUI GAKUTO\u3000\u3000SUMIYA
    MIREI\r\nNEMOTO AIRI\u3000\u3000MIYAHIRA YUYA\r\nSUZUKI RIKUTO\u3000\u3000MORI
    YUSUKE\r\n\r\nVFX Artist\r\nSANO GENTO\u3000\u3000YAMAMOTO KANTA\r\nSHIRAI YUGA\u3000\u3000TAKAMURA
