    Designer\r\nMIYAZAKI HAZUKI\u3000\u3000MABUCHI AKINARI\r\n\r\n2D/UI Artsist\r\nMOCHIZUKI
    YUZUHA\u3000\u3000SAWADA NAOKI\r\nSUGIMOTO MUTSUKI\u3000\u3000YOSHIZAWA NAOKI\r\n\r\n\r\nSOUND
